Fix delta
=========

:delta: delta field

Plain delta prose with ``delta literal``, a `delta guide`_, a `delta text <https://example.com/delta>`_
link, :emphasis:`delta role` and |delta|.

Interpreted `delta default`, :sub:`delta` and `delta role`:abbreviation: stay, while
*delta star* and **delta strong** are prose.

See https://example.com/delta for delta.

Also `delta shared <https://example.com/s>`_ and `delta shared`_ name one target.

.. _delta guide: https://example.com/delta

.. |delta| replace:: delta

.. |other| replace:: delta words

.. delta comment

